{{There rose a great mountain}} the color of iron, and enthroned on it One of such great glory that {{it overwhelmed all sight}}. {{On either side a soft shadow spread out, like a wing of great width and reach.}} Before him, at the foot of the mountain, stood an image full of eyes on all sides, in which, because of those eyes, {{no human form could be made out}}. In front of this image stood another, a child wearing a tunic of subdued color but white shoes, upon whose head such glory descended from the One enthroned upon that mountain that I could not look at its face. But from the One who sat enthroned upon that mountain many living sparks sprang forth, which flew very sweetly around the images. {{In the mountain were many small windows, and in them were heads, some dull in color and some white.}}

{{Then the one seated on the mountain called out in a loud, strong voice}}, "O human, who are fragile dust of the earth and ashes of ashes! Cry out and speak of the origin of pure salvation until those people are instructed, who, though they see the inmost contents of the Scriptures, do not wish to tell them or preach them, because they are lukewarm and sluggish in serving God's justice. {{Open for them the walled place of secrets that they, being fearful, keep shut in a barren, hidden field.}} {{Break out like a spring and spill over with what is known in secret}}, until they who now think you contemptible because of Eve's transgression are stirred up by the flood of your irrigation. For you have received your profound insight not from humans, but from the lofty and tremendous Judge on high, {{where this calm will shine out strongly among the bright ones}}.

"Arise therefore, cry out and tell what is shown to you by the strong power of God's help, for He Who rules every creature in might and kindness {{fills those who stand in awe and serve with gentle love and lowliness}} with the glory of heavenly enlightenment and leads those who persevere in the way of justice to the joys of the Eternal Vision." Then the eyes on the image closed one by one, and the windows went dark.

